    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"fear-mongering tactic\"? that's a pretty intense way to describe a major legal and constitutional debate. if the argument for oversight is just \"misunderstanding\" the role, doesn't that mean the checks and balances system is basically broken? it seems like you're saying the legislative branch has no real way to hold the executive accountable if they can't see what's actually happening.",
